{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年47歲的無綫（TVB）節目主持「6號」陸浩明，與模特兒女友陳詩欣（Ayan）拍拖超過十年，感情一直相當穩定。今日（28日）6號於社交平台突襲公布喜訊，貼出多張在馬爾代夫求婚的照片，正式宣布求婚成功，結束14年愛情長跑！</p><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169998081048317952625814.jpeg/P1dYJiYx0oh6PFcrzSHFYhL9AJdAEvZnjIOqhoyDqoY\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169998078149922816238657.jpeg/_oO_8-QPQK0r607KFrT2U-RqyzO8QOE0Zbu8kGW7vJA\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169998075830341632607429.jpeg/aSpOy4kI5rlcsByNultRXNbwUS56UP5xzQ__dM0P_3Q\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169998073301045248589632.jpeg/f37PbXAEdbBhVQZvGh2S2W0geeYwP2mQKFbgdihW4HY\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><p>感人告白：遇上妳係我一生最大嘅禮物</p><p>6號在Instagram曬出於求婚現場的甜蜜合照，相中二人高調放閃，女友Ayan戴上求婚戒指，笑得相當燦爛。6號寫下感人深情的告白感言，承諾會用盡全力的愛護對方：</p><p>「Yeah! 我求婚成功🫶🏻</p><p>我會用一萬倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂❤️</p><p>求婚時聽到你天使般嘅笑聲令我最甜蜜感動</p><p>以後嘅日子，你會成為我最幸福嘅家人</p><p>遇上妳係我一生最大嘅禮物</p><p>Love You 小公主💕」</p><p>網民及圈中好友紛紛送上祝福</p><p>帖文一出，即吸引大批圈中好友及網民留言道賀。6號與Ayan拍拖多年來不時在小紅書、Instagram等社交平台大放閃光彈，近年亦多次傳出婚訊，如今二人終於修成正果，不少粉絲都為他們感到十分開心，紛紛留言祝福二人白頭到老、永結同心。</p><figure><img alt=\"好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169999476748980224095271.jpeg/F2bpT6Q38CUBkwdoMhOLIK6FTVpuDqCYgGI2lIBiNpQ\"/><figcaption>好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169999474165157888981243.jpeg/Vk-iTBGuLmf71Kvc7lhNvGcp1o1SFNUxAVGkagFRpGo\"/><figcaption>好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169999472000765952450968.jpeg/I8czTaCjlvWv2DJyP2j3lG1mh1W8B1fl3J9G9tyfRvY\"/><figcaption>好浪漫！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6號與女友相戀多年，依然非常幸福。（IG@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231224/815651078732255232028479.jpeg/S76_oaElYI0g_yUeXbZIybh8Ih4x3L78_ijll_4o5Zc\"/><figcaption>6號與女友相戀多年，依然非常幸福。（IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200815/371408297875607552.jpeg/WQ5-EVuG1bKvrIMceivTNxu9Ys0NUzpEfysKvX8rCr0\"/><figcaption>放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200815/371408296134971392.jpeg/NJbM14hrAX12NJLE5P29BaLRBd9dUMpp8Yf3p_GH96c\"/><figcaption>放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恩愛！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200815/371408298542501888.jpeg/KO5hCzEbBw_etNNo55VMFaoGwor6dZvf6H-GmOh_hpg\"/><figcaption>恩愛！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200815/371408290481049600.jpeg/EXbUWmxZgtbpXqCQkdrQY5GzgddQdtM-ZlsI3mZbCN4\"/><figcaption>放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200815/371408292410429440.jpeg/23uC42jF8_bJ0MNagpXVbxk-YlcjG0WCa2oDZGtqA2Q\"/><figcaption>放閃日常！（IG/@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T05:39:19.900786+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":673,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}